   316	# 0a. PLAN-081 Phase 2 — Pair-Rail dispatcher resolution (--pair-mode).
   317	#     When --pair-mode is set AND CEO_PAIR_RAIL_DISABLE != 1, this block:
   318	#       1. Loads .claude/dispatcher/routing-matrix.yaml via
