   325	#       5. Emits dispatcher_route audit event with the decision.
   326	#       6. Sets PAIR_RAIL_HEADER which is printed as "## PAIR-RAIL DISPATCH"
   327	#          section instructing the caller to spawn coder via primary rail
   328	#          and pair the reviewer (via mcp__codex__codex PostToolUse) per
   329	#          ADR-106 advisory semantics.
